{"id":"campeon-gabacho-tmdb-1629064","type":"MOVIE","category":"CINE","title":"Campeón Gabacho","overview":"Liborio, an endearing and mischievous young migrant whose only talent is taking punches. He crosses the Rio Grande to escape a harsh reality in Mexico, looking for a better life in the United States, and settles in a Latino barrio in New York City. Through his fists, his love, and his words, he faces cultural walls and prejudices that threaten his hopes, and becomes a hero in an unknown land.","releaseDate":"2026-10-29","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xW9Nb12f1KS2GlXipeYhICuT55j.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/iEgFyDCt2YNRLhCb98KrdgYbpxB.jpg","genres":["Drama","Romance"],"originalLanguage":"en","spokenLanguages":["English","Spanish"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/iEgFyDCt2YNRLhCb98KrdgYbpxB.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/cOLMmCVhtcj2WElHWUfY4WUSRl6.jpg","label":"Escena 02"}],"ratings":{},"availability":{},"cast":[{"name":"Juan Daniel Garcia Treviño","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAfi4GWcj77QoGwLyBY0o9PIzb0.jpg","personTmdbId":2614141,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Leslie Grace","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iagnGYDvHQJclR4EuUA8E6nSW1z.jpg","personTmdbId":2286683,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Rubén Blades","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOgVo3qDJ9jXgIZJRJI3I1bm6sA.jpg","personTmdbId":2049,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Eddie Marsan","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9atfOgIxhfOKvv2be8HEp6SzOct.jpg","personTmdbId":1665,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Rosario Dawson","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/siTzOI810a0K46wv1TORXMw5N7J.jpg","personTmdbId":5916,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Cheech Marin","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eecHDNRn9K80ZcuSocsMhQb2G1i.jpg","personTmdbId":11159,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Marvin Jones III","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nS4X8TP3idFsxDdV9UqTRbz5